+    """`brsl $rX, .+4` / `ai $rX, $rX, K` / `bi(d/e) $rX`: a PC-getter whose sum is
+    branched to at once. The target is the constant link + K -- an interrupt window
+    or a skip, never a call -- so the `bi` can be a direct branch instead of a trip
+    through spu_indirect_branch. Sony's WWS jobs open their DMA critical sections
