+"        c[i] = Cur[uint2(clamp(o + int2(i % 6, i / 6), int2(0, 0), int2(QW - 1, QH - 1)))];\n"
+"    int2 pb = min(int2(id.xy) / 4, int2(GSW - 1, GSH - 1));\n"
