+" *     The vectors are known at this frame's pixels, so the pixel q with q + (1 - T) v(q) = x is\n"
+" *     looked for from five starts (x and 16 pixels to each side), two steps each; of those that\n"
+" *     land on x the nearest surface wins (what is in front covers what is behind);\n"
+" *   - that surface is taken from both frames and mixed by T, unless the frame before had\n"
